id: power-plating
name: Power Plating
order: 3
optionOf: survivor
optionEffect: 2
description: >
  Increase your Wound Rolls by your Plating’s Apparel Bonus.
text: >
  Power Plating [Passive]: Increase your Wound Rolls by your Plating’s Apparel Bonus.

---

# The Plating's Apparel Bonus - nothing while it is Inactive (actor-character.mjs naturalArmor).
[passive]
wound += naturalArmor.apparelBonus;
